Subject: [PATCH] WIP: M3-BPR-404: boss-intro camera fits each boss's model
 bounds (Hullgnaw framing bug)

The intro shot keeps its angle and fov; its distance fits a sphere around the boss's visible meshes in the
narrower field of view (choreo.json boss_intro.fit: margin, look_drop, min_m, max_m, widen_max), widening until
the boss's top and bottom pass the safe frame; rows may override fit_margin (the Inquisitor 1.6) or set fit
false. boss_intro tests 14/0. Viewed: Hullgnaw, Matron, Hermit, Wraith, Drownbell read well; the Inquisitor
with fit_margin 1.6 not yet viewed. Baselines NOT re-approved yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014EcW9e5tEmjDi5S2HmCECd
