Subject: [PATCH] M3-BPR-404: boss intros clear the title card; fit search,
 tests, six baselines (FAST-TRACK)

The fitted shot must keep the boss's feet above the title card's top edge (fit.card_clear_px): it aims lower
first (drop_step to drop_max), then widens the clamped distance (widen_step to widen_max). The Inquisitor's
fit_margin 1.6 is gone; the general rule frames him. Tests: the fit follows the model size and keeps the angle,
fit_margin overrides, every boss clears the card. All six battle_boss_intro_* shots viewed and re-approved.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
